 \label{eq:mj-muscle}
\end{equation}
The negative sign denotes a pulling actuator force; both active and passive terms contribute to tension. The rigid tendon has a constant length, but no elastic state. MuJoCo also omits pennation, so its differences from the OpenSim equilibrium formulations are not limited to tendon compliance \citep{mujoco_muscle_docs_237}.

